00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:07.310
period A deputy’s job title alone does not show

00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:09.205
that this work has been accepted

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:15.586
The incoming owner needs competence specific authority individual access

00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:20.270
and the current work record Show open actions owners

00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:22.955
deadlines and unresolved gaps

00:00:23.793 --> 00:00:29.162
Administrative cover and control-room monitoring are different lanes Obtain

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:33.307
the relevant acceptance in each lane notify affected people

00:00:33.346 --> 00:00:35.386
